297-    Returns a SweepSummary whose medians should be near zero. Use it as
298-    the null hypothesis when judging whether a real signal's sweep shows
299-    structure beyond randomness.
300-
301-    Args:
302-        bars: full bar series (length is used only for the signal shape).
303-        param_grid, train_window, test_window, warmup, overlap_window, cfg, periods_per_year:
